01:21:09,348 --> 01:21:10,487
- He's... - Gosh.

2085
01:21:10,488 --> 01:21:11,548
He's quiet.

2086
01:21:11,888 --> 01:21:12,917
What a good boy.

2087
01:21:12,918 --> 01:21:13,957
(Calm)

2088
01:21:13,958 --> 01:21:15,158
I think...

2089
01:21:15,218 --> 01:21:16,557
he's really gentle.

2090
01:21:16,558 --> 01:21:17,558
It's not that he's gentle.

2091
01:21:17,559 --> 01:21:18,957
- Maybe he doesn't feel it? - He's so gentle.

2092
01:21:18,958 --> 01:21:20,004
(He's calm even after getting the second shot.)

2093
01:21:20,028 --> 01:21:21,057
Oh, my.

2094
01:21:21,058 --> 01:21:23,098
(Sunmoo has no problem getting shots.)

2095
01:21:23,228 --> 01:21:25,098
How can he not make any noise?

2096
01:21:25,528 --> 01:21:27,167
- Maybe he doesn't feel it? - Good boy.

2097
01:21:27,168 --> 01:21:29,337
(The puppy doesn't even cry and gets shots well.)

2098
01:21:29,338 --> 01:21:30,538
He's unfazed.

2099
01:21:31,338 --> 01:21:32,507
He's okay, right?

2100
01:21:32,508 --> 01:21:34,107
Of course. He's so...

2101
01:21:34,108 --> 01:21:35,514
- He's not affected at all? - Right?

2102
01:21:35,538 --> 01:21:37,077
There aren't many dogs who don't feel pain...

2103
01:21:37,078 --> 01:21:39,077
- after getting shots. - I know.

2104
01:21:39,078 --> 01:21:41,447
- Right? They whine, right? - Yes.

2105
01:21:41,448 --> 01:21:43,087
It's because he's gentle in nature.

2106
01:21:43,088 --> 01:21:44,488
- I see. - He's so cute.

2107
01:21:45,318 --> 01:21:48,858
He's like a miracle.

2108
01:21:49,928 --> 01:21:51,627
He's worth studying.

2109
01:21:51,628 --> 01:21:54,004
He's a case where a veterinary paper could be written about.

2110
01:21:54,028 --> 01:21:55,948
The thesis topic is, "What's Wrong With Sunmoo?"

2111
01:21:56,528 --> 01:21:59,027
Even dogs who are patient...

2112
01:21:59,028 --> 01:22:01,498
blink a little when the needle goes in.

2113
01:22:01,838 --> 01:22:02,868
Or do this.

2114
01:22:03,768 --> 01:22:05,308
He didn't flinch at all.

2115
01:22:05,438 --> 01:22:07,878
The needle was quite big too.

2116
01:22:09,008 --> 01:22:10,877
(He calmly took the shots.)

2117
01:22:10,878 --> 01:22:11,908
This is all he did.

2118
01:22:12,348 --> 01:22:15,078
He'll become a great figure.

2119
01:22:15,318 --> 01:22:16,518
He'll become something.

2120
01:22:17,388 --> 01:22:19,718
- Now we can take a walk. - Yes, you can.

2121
01:22:19,818 --> 01:22:21,758
- I can walk him on a harness. - Yes.

2122
01:22:21,858 --> 01:22:23,588
- He can shower once in two weeks. - Yes.

2123
01:22:23,658 --> 01:22:24,978
Do I not need to change his food?

2124
01:22:25,388 --> 01:22:26,427
When can he be neutered?

2125
01:22:26,428 --> 01:22:29,458
He can be neutered when he's around 5 to 7 months.

2126
01:22:29,828 --> 01:22:31,427
After all his vaccination shots...

2127
01:22:31,428 --> 01:22:33,014
- After everything is done? - Yes, when they're done.

2128
01:22:33,038 --> 01:22:36,538
We'll book his neutering around that time.

2129
01:22:36,808 --> 01:22:39,367
All right. There aren't more things I should take note of, right?

2130
01:22:39,368 --> 01:22:40,707
No. I think he'll be fine.

2131
01:22:40,708 --> 01:22:43,348
- You can wash him a day after. - All right.

2132
01:22:43,878 --> 01:22:45,778
- Thank you. - Sure.

2133
01:22:46,178 --> 01:22:48,618
- I'll see you in two weeks. - Look at him going to Hyun Moo.

2134
01:22:50,318 --> 01:22:51,517
He's so cute.

2135
01:22:51,518 --> 01:22:53,918
He felt stuffed when I put him in a backpack.

2136
01:22:54,518 --> 01:22:56,057
- Thank you. - Sure. Thank you.

2137
01:22:56,058 --> 01:22:57,698
- I'll see you in two weeks. - All right.

2138
01:22:58,558 --> 01:22:59,857
(Veterinary Clinic)

2139
01:22:59,858 --> 01:23:01,097
You're a good boy.

2140
01:23:01,098 --> 01:23:02,558
(Veterinary Clinic)

2141
01:23:03,798 --> 01:23:06,638
Gosh, well done, Sunmoo.

2142
01:23:06,998 --> 01:23:08,338
Fathermoo is back.

2143
01:23:10,068 --> 01:23:11,437
(Packed with things)

2144
01:23:11,438 --> 01:23:12,538
Gosh, they're so heavy.

2145
01:23:13,178 --> 01:23:15,237
Gosh, they're so heavy.

2146
01:23:15,238 --> 01:23:17,748
- He really bought a lot. - He bought so much.

2147
01:23:18,078 --> 01:23:20,578
Here. There you go.

2148
01:23:20,778 --> 01:23:21,948
Have fun.

2149
01:23:23,848 --> 01:23:25,347
(I'm home!)

2150
01:23:25,348 --> 01:23:26,348
Goodness.

2151
01:23:28,088 --> 01:23:29,318
Gosh, I'm so tired.

2152
01:23:29,458 --> 01:23:31,088
(Staring)

2153
01:23:31,588 --> 01:23:33,057
Why did I get so much stuff?

2154
01:23:33,058 --> 01:23:38,128
(He starts unpacking as soon as he gets home.)

2155
01:23:42,468 --> 01:23:43,638
I did buy a lot.

2156
01:23:44,108 --> 01:23:46,007
I don't think you can tell what's what.

2157
01:23:46,008 --> 01:23:47,888
(He takes out the things he splurged on today.)

2158
01:23:48,778 --> 01:23:50,247
That's the thing you got.

2159
01:23:50,248 --> 01:23:51,348
The popular item.

2160
01:23:52,878 --> 01:23:54,948
Some dogs are scared of toys like that.

2161
01:23:55,178 --> 01:23:56,488
Please like it.

2162
01:23:57,748 --> 01:23:59,718
(Will he like it?)

2163
01:24:00,418 --> 01:24:02,287
- He's showing interest. - Right.

2164
01:24:02,288 --> 01:24:03,528
I did well getting that.

2165
01:24:04,788 --> 01:24:06,157
(Impressed)

2166
01:24:06,158 --> 01:24:07,258
You're attacking it.

2167
01:24:07,428 --> 01:24:08,727
- Look at you. - Oh, my.

2168
01:24:08,728 --> 01:24:09,768
Oh, my.

2169
01:24:10,428 --> 01:24:12,027
- He has a lot of strength. - He's strong.

2170
01:24:12,028 --> 01:24:13,898
(Fearless dog)

2171
01:24:16,198 --> 01:24:18,307
He took the shots with no problem. That's not a big deal.

2172
01:24:18,308 --> 01:24:19,878
- It's heavy. - He's fearless.

2173
01:24:19,978 --> 01:24:21,537
- He's not scared. - Look at you.

2174
01:24:21,538 --> 01:24:22,838
(Biting)

2175
01:24:23,608 --> 01:24:25,047
He's shaking.

2176
01:24:25,048 --> 01:24:27,848
(Shaking)

2177
01:24:28,648 --> 01:24:30,087
It's almost like mixed martial arts.

2178
01:24:30,088 --> 01:24:31,317
(I never let go of a turtle once I bite it.)

2179
01:24:31,318 --> 01:24:32,488
He loves it.

2180
01:24:33,688 --> 01:24:35,418
I did well by getting a moving toy.

2181
01:24:37,258 --> 01:24:38,488
It was money well spent.

2182
01:24:39,588 --> 01:24:42,328
Sunmoo, come here. Let's try on the dog tank top.

2183
01:24:42,898 --> 01:24:44,028
Dog tank top?

2184
01:24:45,128 --> 01:24:46,198
Come on.

2185
01:24:48,038 --> 01:24:49,098
Gosh, good boy.

2186
01:24:50,368 --> 01:24:52,314
- He's so cute. - He's calm when wearing clothes.

2187
01:24:52,338 --> 01:24:54,177
- Many dogs hate it too. - That's right.

2188
01:24:54,178 --> 01:24:55,238
(Gentle)

2189
01:24:55,738 --> 01:24:57,447
Oh, my. It suits him so well.

2190
01:24:57,448 --> 01:24:59,128
It must feel rewarding to get him clothes.

2191
01:24:59,408 --> 01:25:01,218
It looks good on you. It's pretty.

2192
01:25:02,118 --> 01:25:03,188
That was a good buy.

2193
01:25:04,018 --> 01:25:05,748
It was a good buy. I'm super happy.

2194
01:25:06,418 --> 01:25:07,518
Let me...

2195
01:25:07,888 --> 01:25:09,218
Gosh, this is so comfortable.

2196
01:25:11,128 --> 01:25:13,898
(Drained)

2197
01:25:15,298 --> 01:25:17,968
(He gets up right away even while resting.)

2198
01:25:22,038 --> 01:25:23,937
(Passing out after taking care of his dog all day)

2199
01:25:23,938 --> 01:25:25,308
It's really tiring.

2200
01:25:32,278 --> 01:25:33,678
He's a blessing.

2201
01:25:34,548 --> 01:25:38,787
My parents often go to the hospital,

2202
01:25:38,788 --> 01:25:40,087
so there isn't much for them to smile about.

2203
01:25:40,088 --> 01:25:42,358
But they do smile a lot these days.

2204
01:25:43,458 --> 01:25:44,858
They'd go, "My dear Goofball."

2205
01:25:45,028 --> 01:25:48,157
My father goes for dialysis three times a week.

2206
01:25:48,158 --> 01:25:49,597
(His father has dialysis three times a week.)

2207
01:25:49,598 --> 01:25:53,598
There must be no joy even when they come back home.

2208
01:25:53,698 --> 01:25:55,967
Their son isn't married...

2209
01:25:55,968 --> 01:25:58,067
and is only getting old. They wouldn't be happy.

2210
01:25:58,068 --> 01:26:00,578
But thanks to him, they became really happy.

2211
01:26:00,908 --> 01:26:03,007
They don't call or text me unless they want to...

2212
01:26:03,008 --> 01:26:07,118
nag at me about having meals or putting on socks.

2213
01:26:07,518 --> 01:26:09,778
But now, regardless of nagging,

2214
01:26:10,018 --> 01:26:11,348
they'd send photos of him.

2215
01:26:11,788 --> 01:26:13,518
"He ate well today too."

2216
01:26:14,558 --> 01:26:16,417
This one really is a good son project.

2217
01:26:16,418 --> 01:26:18,327
- Do you approve of this? - Yes, I do approve of it.

2218
01:26:18,328 --> 01:26:20,328
Now, he only has to give them a peck on the cheek.

2219
01:26:21,428 --> 01:26:22,858
I realized they were really happy.

2220
01:26:23,368 --> 01:26:24,768
I did well by bringing him.

2221
01:26:25,398 --> 01:26:28,138
It's the finale of the five-year good son project.

2222
01:26:28,868 --> 01:26:30,468
What? That's it?

2223
01:26:31,168 --> 01:26:33,507
- It's the end. - Isn't it too fast?

2224
01:26:33,508 --> 01:26:34,508
The end.

2225
01:26:34,708 --> 01:26:36,707
(Sunmoo, be a good son for my sake too.)

2226
01:26:36,708 --> 01:26:38,278
Sunmoo, you'll have to do all the job.

2227
01:26:38,948 --> 01:26:41,877
There are so many things Sunmoo can do...

2228
01:26:41,878 --> 01:26:43,448
to be a good son instead of me.

2229
01:26:44,888 --> 01:26:47,717
(The End of the 5-year Good Son Project)

2230
01:26:47,718 --> 01:26:50,927
(The End of the 5-year Good Son Project?)

2231
01:26:50,928 --> 01:26:52,428
(Next story)

2232
01:26:53,088 --> 01:26:54,527
(She showed a good performance as the competent eldest daughter...)

2233
01:26:54,528 --> 01:26:55,658
(on "Reply 1988.")

2234
01:26:55,998 --> 01:26:59,498
(A scene-stealer full of charisma)

2235
01:26:59,938 --> 01:27:02,018
(It's been 11 years since she started living alone.)

2236
01:27:02,138 --> 01:27:03,908
(It's Actress Ryu Hye Young.)

2237
01:27:04,908 --> 01:27:06,808
(In every corner of her dark house, )

2238
01:27:07,678 --> 01:27:09,308
(there lie Hye Young's charming pieces.)

2239
01:27:09,838 --> 01:27:14,118
(Hye Young wakes up in a pitch-dark room.)

2240
01:27:15,518 --> 01:27:17,487
(Peeking)

2241
01:27:17,488 --> 01:27:19,048
(Get some sunlight.)

2242
01:27:20,558 --> 01:27:22,918
(She only allows a ray of sunlight to her plant friend.)

2243
01:27:24,058 --> 01:27:26,057
(In the corner of a dark living room, )

2244
01:27:26,058 --> 01:27:28,858
(she fiddles around.)

2245
01:27:29,998 --> 01:27:33,298
(I'm a timid person who's easily scared.)

2246
01:27:34,538 --> 01:27:36,768
(I just saw you, Wilson.)

2247
01:27:37,668 --> 01:27:41,108
(You're a scary one, aren't you?)

2248
01:27:41,978 --> 01:27:45,778
(I used to feel insecure about myself.)

2249
01:27:46,208 --> 01:27:48,018
(But why must I hide?)

2250
01:27:48,878 --> 01:27:50,748
(World, here I come.)

2251
01:27:51,088 --> 01:27:52,288
Let's just do it.

2252
01:27:52,448 --> 01:27:54,618
(Here comes Ryu Hye Young!)

2253
01:27:54,788 --> 01:27:56,928
(I'm quite fast today.)

2254
01:27:58,488 --> 01:28:00,328
(Taking little steps)

2255
01:28:00,758 --> 01:28:02,828
(I'm going past you.)

2256
01:28:03,828 --> 01:28:06,268
(Don't worry too much about what others think.)

2257
01:28:07,098 --> 01:28:09,798
(Things she learned after a long journey of time)

2258
01:28:11,408 --> 01:28:12,637
- This is nice. - At my own pace...

2259
01:28:12,638 --> 01:28:14,538
(I just need to go at my own pace.)

2260
01:28:15,278 --> 01:28:17,508
(This is great!)

2261
01:28:18,148 --> 01:28:19,478
(Taking little steps)

2262
01:28:20,048 --> 01:28:22,618
(At My Own Pace)

2263
01:28:23,178 --> 01:28:25,647
(CODE KUNST who always takes things easy)

2264
01:28:25,648 --> 01:28:27,488
