2285
01:29:06,128 --> 01:29:09,328
(Getting excited from the start)

2286
01:29:09,758 --> 01:29:12,598
(He pushed Kang In? I can't hold back!)

2287
01:29:13,198 --> 01:29:14,398
(Let's play well!)

2288
01:29:15,068 --> 01:29:16,167
(Going through...)

2289
01:29:16,168 --> 01:29:17,838
(extreme highs and lows)

2290
01:29:22,738 --> 01:29:26,978
(We'll Cheer for Team Korea)
